Server init.

>> x := Blob ncha: 65 mofuta: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Lenaneo tlhophiso: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server hokahanya: (
 Lethathamo ncha ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Lethathamo ncha ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x ho-tloha: 0 bolelele: 1), mola-o-mocha.
x lokolla.

